# data/ carries language/ecosystem/toolchain identifiers (extensions, program names, shebangs) that look like typos but are real values; "statics" is the Rust term used throughout the prose. site/content/langbank.json is the same data, printed for the documentation site.
[codespell]
skip = ./data,./site/content/langbank.json,*.lock,package-lock.json,*.svg,*.woff2,*.min.js,target,node_modules,.git,dist,out,vendor
ignore-words-list = statics,edn,als,ect,wast,ameba,embold,synopsys,infact,defint,ags,udo,tese,ned,te,mata,crate
